              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukuze uvule amehlo abo, basuke ebumnyameni, baye ekukhanyeni, basuke emandleni kaSathane, baye kuNkulunkulu, ukuze bamukele ukuthethelelwa kwezono, nefa phakathi kwabangcwelisiweyo ngokukholwa kimi.",
          "type": "text",
