          "text": "UPawuli wasesithi: Ngithanda kuNkulunkulu ukuthi, kungabi nguwe wedwa, kodwa labo bonke abangizwayo lamuhla, kokubili ngokuseduze, nangokuphelele, babe njengami, ngaphandle kwalezizibopho.",
